# Line endings are decided here, not by each contributor's core.autocrlf. The repository
# stores LF and a checkout gets the platform's own, so Windows and Linux never fight over them.
* text=auto

# Vendored third party: never line-ending converted, and not counted as this project's own code
# in the language statistics. See third_party/README.md.
third_party/** -text linguist-vendored
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.bmp binary

# Patches apply byte for byte to the LF sources they were made from.
*.patch -text
*.diff -text
